desc
@Program that tests the tabular coordinate routines using PGPLOT to demonstrate
the nature of linear interpolation in 2 dimensions by contouring the interior
of a single 2 x 2 interpolation element as the values in each corner change.
@


8.10
log
@WCSLIB 8.10
@
text
@/*============================================================================
